# Cloudflare Pages path redirects for the manual site, ported from
# netlify.toml. Copied into the deploy root by scripts/render-quarto.py.
# Host-based redirects (legacy subdomains) live in the redirect Worker
# (cloudflare/redirect-worker/), not here - Pages ignores host rules.
# /index.html -> / and 404.html handling are automatic on Pages.

# Scoreboard embed configurator (replaced delay-counter-preview.html).
# Extensionless target: Pages 308s .html URLs to clean URLs, so pointing at
# the .html form would add a second redirect hop.
/delay-counter-preview.html /assets/scoreboard-embed 301
/scoreboard /assets/scoreboard-embed 302
